			shape: "star"
			size: 1.3d
			dependencies: ["8C14D5A43E08F8BB"]
			description: [
				"&d&o\"The sea is more than a road to the Leviathan, Dreamer. Stay a while.\""
				""
				"&7This path shows what the islands of the &bEndless Sea&7 offer besides the story: guarded places and their captains, a sail for your own raft, a cozy home that heals you, crops and a kitchen, and gear for an islander."
			]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "0A7B861F2F395E45", type: "checkmark", title: "Off to the islands" }
			]
			rewards: [
				{ id: "0A747A1F2F332B33", type: "xp", xp: 30 }
			]
		}
		{
			id: "74D74A09EEE584D4"
			title: "Guarded Places"
			icon: "raft:scavenger_spawn_egg"
			x: 1.8d
			y: 1.8d
			dependencies: ["5A842BF26F504A36"]
			description: [
				"&7Most places of the sea are guarded. The first time you come close, a warning sounds - a shout, a horn, the hum of the reef - and two seconds later the guards appear around the unopened chests."
				"&7The guards get tougher the further the story leads you: scavengers with fists, wooden blades or bows at the start, stone blades and reef guardians in the middle, corsair crews at the end. Easy has one guard less, Hard one more; Saltmere, the castaway camp and the sanctum stay quiet."
			]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "B16609E21D203BE4"
					type: "kill"
					entity: "raft:scavenger"
					value: 3
				}
			]
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "B15F7DE21D1AE252"
					type: "item"
					count: 6
					item: "raft:gold_coin"
				}
				{ id: "B15F7EE21D1AE405", type: "xp", xp: 80 }
			]
		}
		{
			id: "CAB4CADF433572A2"
			title: "Reef Guardians"
			icon: "raft:reef_guardian_spawn_egg"
			x: 3.6d
			y: 1.8d
			dependencies: ["74D74A09EEE584D4"]
			description: [
				"&7A &eReef Guardian&7 is a guardian overgrown with coral. It charges its beam for a few seconds before it hits - watch the glow and break its line of sight. Its spikes hurt."
				"&7They guard the sunken ruins, the wrecks, the Helix Station, the rusted rigs and the Coral Temple. They drop prismarine, sea glass and pearls."
			]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "861B8C3FA378E007"
					type: "kill"
					entity: "raft:reef_guardian"
					value: 2
				}
			]
			rewards: [
