			x: 0.0d
			y: -1.8d
			dependencies: ["AC556A4B8EE5C382"]
			optional: true
			description: [
				"&7Palm, teak and weathered &eShelves&7 show three items and work like vanilla shelves. The &eWicker Basket&7 holds 9 stacks and keeps them when you pick it up, like a shulker box."
				"&7Put a &eServing Plate&7 on a table: it holds up to 4 portions of one food. Right-click with an empty hand to eat one when you are hungry."
