			description: [
				"&7Wild &eSweet Potatoes&7, &eChili&7, &eBananas&7 and &eRice&7 grow on the palm, jungle, mangrove and volcanic isles (in newly explored chunks). Seeds also come with flotsam barrels, supply barrels, island chests and overworld shipwrecks."
				"&7Plant them on farmland or a crop plot; each has four stages. A raw chili gives 10 seconds of Fire Resistance."
			]
