				"&7&eIsland Curry&7: cooked rice, chili, sweet potato and coconut (3 bowls, Regeneration). &eSeafood Chowder&7: a fish, crab claw or eel fillet, sweet potato, kelp and sea grapes (3 bowls, Water Breathing)."
